Package: accessmod
Title: Run AccessMod 6 Accessibility Analyses from R
Version: 6.0.0.9002
Authors@R: person("Fred", "Moser", email = "frederic.moser@unige.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A project session over the AccessMod 6 engine: installs the
    released engine for the platform, opens or imports projects (AccessMod 6
    project files and AccessMod 5 data archives), selects datasets and the
    jobs of past runs by type, class and tags, derives scenarios from them,
    and runs any analysis (merge land cover, travel time, ...) on the project.
License: LGPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/unige-geohealth/accessmod_rs
BugReports: https://github.com/unige-geohealth/accessmod_rs/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: digest, jsonlite, R6, tools, utils
Suggests: terra, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/accessmod/engine: 6.0.0-alpha.2
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
